IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- s 11 (approval of equipment) and the offence in s 71 that attaches to it.
-- (s 11(2) to (7): the Authority's conditions, fees and the licensee's right to cease supply; deferred, see COVERAGE.md.)

§ `s 11 Approval of equipment`

-- src:1181 | 11.—(1) The following equipment must be approved by the
-- src:1182 | Authority before use:
-- src:1184 | (a) any equipment to be used for connection (whether directly
-- src:1185 | or indirectly) to any telecommunication system;
-- src:1187 | (b) any equipment to be used as an adjunct to or in conjunction
-- src:1188 | with any telecommunication system; and
-- src:1190 | (c) any equipment belonging to a telecommunication system
-- src:1191 | licensee.
@ref s 11(1) (src:1181-1191)
GIVEN `to be used for connection, directly or indirectly, to a telecommunication system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `to be used as an adjunct to or in conjunction with a telecommunication system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `belongs to a telecommunication system licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 11(1): the equipment must be approved by the Authority before use` MEANS
        `to be used for connection, directly or indirectly, to a telecommunication system`
    OR `to be used as an adjunct to or in conjunction with a telecommunication system`
    OR `belongs to a telecommunication system licensee`

§ `s 71 Failure to disconnect equipment not approved under section 11`

-- src:5394 | 71. Where —
-- src:5396 | (a) any person has under the person’s control a
-- src:5397 | telecommunication system or equipment connected to
-- src:5398 | the telecommunication system or equipment of a
-- src:5399 | telecommunication system licensee which is of a type
-- src:5400 | not approved by the Authority under section 11;
-- src:5402 | (b) the Authority has given to the person a written notice
-- src:5403 | stating that —
-- src:5405 | (i) the telecommunication system or equipment under
-- src:5406 | the person’s control is of a type that has not been
-- src:5407 | approved by the Authority under section 11; and
-- src:5409 | (ii) the person must disconnect the telecommunication
-- src:5410 | system or equipment from the telecommunication
-- src:5411 | system or equipment of the telecommunication
-- src:5412 | system licensee within such period as specified in
-- src:5413 | the notice; and
-- src:5415 | (c) the person has failed to comply with any written notice
-- src:5416 | under paragraph (b),
-- src:5418 | then the person shall be guilty of an offence.
@ref s 71 (src:5394-5418)
GIVEN `the person has under the person's control a telecommunication system or equipment connected to a licensee's system or equipment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is of a type not approved by the Authority under section 11` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority gave the person a written notice of that and requiring disconnection within a period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person failed to comply with the notice` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 71: the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
        `the person has under the person's control a telecommunication system or equipment connected to a licensee's system or equipment`
    AND `it is of a type not approved by the Authority under section 11`
    AND `the Authority gave the person a written notice of that and requiring disconnection within a period`
    AND `the person failed to comply with the notice`
